Custom Framework

The UI engine in src/engine started from Atlas.
https://github.com/0Zayn/Atlas

Icon CSS under assets/icons/fontawesome is Font Awesome Pro metadata.
The webfonts themselves are not in this tree. Place your licensed
.woff2 files next to the CSS if you want glyph images.

Spotify and Discord credentials stay in .env. Nothing in this tree is a secret.

Windows Media, WinHTTP, DirectX, OpenGL, Vulkan, and Win32 are part of the
Windows SDK or the Vulkan SDK.
